WEBVTT

00:09:31.073 --> 00:09:32.641
So what does this all mean?

00:09:33.562 --> 00:09:38.056
It means that music
and psychedelics may be able

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.693
to alter the entire brain
for a period of time,

00:09:41.717 --> 00:09:45.910
and that may lead to a change
in neural circuitry

00:09:45.934 --> 00:09:49.490
that may be stuck in patterns
of negative emotional bias.

00:09:49.514 --> 00:09:52.945
This may be able to give people
a period of relief

00:09:52.969 --> 00:09:55.503
from the grip and the claws
of negative emotion.

00:09:56.675 --> 00:10:00.413
And that may be just enough to give
someone access to new perspectives